(UK)","s":40,"b":"Negative","t":1,"u":"https://www.thetimes.co.uk/article/stranger-things-the-first-shadow-review-you-need-to-be-a-fan-to-follow-this-prequel-blds60b6s","d":"2023-12-15","q":"Amid all the crowd scenes there's little sense of depth to the individual characters or how they relate to one another."},{"cn":"Marianka Swain","o":"London Theatre","s":100,"b":"Rave","t":2,"u":"https://www.londontheatre.co.uk/reviews/stranger-things-the-first-shadow-review-phoenix-theatre","d":"2023-12-15"},{"cn":"Emily Baker","o":"The i","s":80,"b":"Positive","t":2,"u":"https://inews.co.uk/culture/television/stranger-things-the-first-shadow-review-a-cash-cow-but-a-mesmerising-one-2809768?srsltid=AfmBOor78MzqX-DkMZXopworBCurbv4J3Nb7yOecpOPyrrg7hmQsHf14","d":"2023-12-14","q":"The First Shadow is so mesmerising it is impossible not to be stunned by the spectacle of this electrifying show."},{"cn":"Alice Saville","o":"The Independent","s":80,"b":"Positive","t":2,"u":"https://www.independent.co.uk/arts-entertainment/theatre-dance/reviews/stranger-things-the-first-shadow-review-b2464017.html","d":"2023-12-15","q":"It's a massive all-out event calculated to thrill fans of the award-winning Netflix series with explosions, thrills, and jumpscares galore"},{"cn":"Dave Fargnoli","o":"The Stage","s":80,"b":"Positive","t":2,"u":"https://www.thestage.co.uk/long-reviews/stranger-things-the-first-shadow-review-phoenix-theatre-london-duffer-brothers-jack-thorne-stephen-daldry-sonia-friedman","d":"2023-12-15","q":"But it is an extraordinary, gripping spectacle."},{"cn":"Jill Johnson","o":"Lost in Theatreland","s":93,"b":"Rave","t":3,"u":"https://lostintheatreland.co.uk/stranger-things-the-first-shadow-review-phoenix-theatre/","d":"2023-12-18","q":"These are only a few of the incredible people made this production possible; it has taken a massive team to make it genuinely magical, mind-blowing, and thrilling."},{"cn":"Mert Dilek","o":"The Arts Desk","s":80,"b":"Positive","t":3,"u":"https://theartsdesk.com/theatre/stranger-things-first-shadow-phoenix-theatre-review-formidable-stagecraft-unlocks-new-depths","d":"2023-12-15","q":"In this intensely cinematic and technically stunning show, a spirited ensemble breathes ambitious life into a villain origin story that feels at once epic and intimate – and with no shortage of wow factors."},{"cn":"Neil Armstrong","o":"BBC News","s":79,"b":"Positive","t":3,"u":"https://www.bbc.com/culture/article/20231214-stranger-things-the-first-shadow-review-the-theatrical-spin-off-from-the-netflix-mega-hit-is-funny-and-thrilling","d":"2023-12-14","q":"The result is a success in its own right."},{"cn":"Greg Stewart","o":"Theatre Weekly","s":78,"b":"Positive","t":3,"u":"https://theatreweekly.com/review-stranger-things-the-first-shadow-at-the-phoenix-theatre/","d":"2023-12-14","q":"Fans of the Netflix show will feel right at home here, as the world of Hawkins, Indiana is recreated beautifully on the stage."}],"au":{"score":91,"designation":"Loving","sources":{"ss":{"s":93,"c":2726},"mz":{"s":87,"c":2094,"sr":4.3},"sp":{"s":93,"c":1551,"sr":4.64},"lb":{"s":94,"c":180,"sr":4.7},"ltd":{"s":93,"c":389,"sr":4.7}}},"hi":"/images/shows/stranger-things-the-first-shadow-west-end-2023/hero.webp"}